"P4245996024" "<t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor Navy>This is Admiral Sutter to all hands. We have intruders below decks. All Marines prepare to repel boarders."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P4198456544" "<t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor Navy>This is Admiral Sutter to the fleet. All hands to battle stations. This is not a drill. We have enemy surface contact.<t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor Navy>I need my task force to report top side, immediately."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3750096529" "<t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor Navy>This is Sutter. {TaskForceName}, that massive floating 'vessel' off the port bow is where the attackers came from.<t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor Navy>I need your team to disable their weapon systems so we can move in and board them."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1499383448" "<t=5 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor Navy>This is Sutter. {HeroName}, good job on disabling those defensive turrets. We've got them on the ropes.<t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor Navy>Now, locate the source of that Praetorian Rift Signature and let's put an end to their little foray into our dimension."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3366799137" "<t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor Navy>Good job, {HeroName}, but we have a problem.<t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor Navy>Have your team meet me on the stern of the USS Mason and I'll explain."
