"P564358985" "Citadel"
// Script Variable BOSS_1_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1352301651" "<shout>Let's see how you fight on the ground."
// Script Variable BOSS_1_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P1062998635" "<shout>I find your request to be unacceptable. My apologies."
// Script Variable BOSS_2_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1479866081" "<shout>SUBJECT. CITADEL. EXERCISE EXTREME CAUTION."
// Script Variable BOSS_2_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P562029999" "<shout>SURRENDER TO THE GLORIOUS PRAETORIAN EMPIRE AND NO HARM SHALL COME TO YOU.<em>RESIST, AND YOU WILL BE DESTROYED."
// Script Variable BOSS_3_ATTACK_DIALOG :
