// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - ScriptDefeatRearGuard 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Description :
"P3098184146" "Destroy IDF forces in the tunnel"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3572305806" "<t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DarkGoldenRod>{TaskForceName}, this is Luminary. Reports indicate that Skyway City has just suffered a 7.2 magnitude earthquake.<t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DarkGoldenRod>I caution that it is unlikely to be safe in the sewers at this time.<t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DarkGoldenRod>I will keep you informed on further developments since your primary goal remains to find where the Praetorians are headed.<t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DarkGoldenRod>Once you discover their destination we can dispatch Longbow and police to engage them."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2510495505" "<t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DarkGoldenRod>{TaskForceName}, a second quake just hit Skyway City. That is their target. <t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DarkGoldenRod>Praetorian troops are emerging from the sewers and laying siege to the Architect Entertainment Building.<t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DarkGoldenRod>I've dispatched Longbow and the Skyway City Police to intercept them, but they're going to need your help."
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P406272177" "<shout>We've lost contact with the rear guard. Prepare to defend this position!"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P4156480346" "<shout>Right on time."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// CutScene 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// CutScene 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1204552618" "<shout>ENEMY COMBATANTS INBOUND ON OUR POSITION. PREPARE DEFENSE PATTERN THETA."
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3993779157" "<shout>I sense minds intent on stopping us. Do not allow them to pass and interrupt the Colonel's invasion plan."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2952378726" "<shout>Why do you fight? You cannot win."
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3859719455" "<shout>We've got to buy Duray more time!"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3685534520" "<shout>Remember, these are not Powers Division. They're just Primals!"
// Script Variable BOSS_1_DISPLAYNAME :
"P2152271291" "Riptide"
// Script Variable BOSS1_DISPLAYINFO :
"P3282402510" "Riptide is one of the most capable and respected members of the Praetorian's Powers Division. His exceptional combat prowess earned him a spot in the invasion plan instead of tracking down Resistance members beneath the streets of Praetoria's Imperial City."
// Script Variable BOSS_1_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P318915743" "<em t=5><shout>Let them come, I back down from no one."
// Script Variable BOSS_1_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P181050104" "I'm afraid that I cannot allow you to leave here alive."
// Script Variable BOSS_1STBLOOD_DIALOG :
"P988733008" "Let's see what you are made of, Primal."
// Script Variable BOSS_KILLEDHERO_DIALOG :
"P2598574181" "<em victory>As I expected. Not a one of you is Top Dog material."
// Script Variable BOSS_2_DISPLAYNAME :
"P2820904247" "Harbinger"
// Script Variable BOSS2_DISPLAYINFO :
"P1693364705" "This Praetorian seer, code named Harbinger, is wetwired to an advanced command and control interface, allowing her mind to control subjects fitted with receivers in a wide area."
// Script Variable BOSS_2_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1276657949" "<shout>Our uninvited guests have arrived."
// Script Variable BOSS_2_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3070859998" "<shout>I will give them a warm welcome."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1612027994" "Harbinger. Let's mix things up for our guests!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2949159086" "Harbinger. Another mixer, now!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1019116377" "Harbinger. I need every bomb you've got!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - ScriptDefeatRiptideAndHarbinger 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Description :
"P3922776855" "Defeat Riptide and Harbinger"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3700077990" "<color deepskyblue>The Sky Is Falling<br>Part Two: Operation Boomerang<br><br></color>Earthquakes are ravaging Skyway City and the Praetorian IDF is fighting a brutal shock and awe invasion of the city. Their rear guard is broken and soon you'll put an end to this invasion!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound1_Part3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2209751891" "Defend Skyway City"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P4014089702" "<color deepskyblue>The Sky Is Falling<br>Part Three: Operation Firebrand<br><br></color>Skyway City is being wracked by earthquakes and the Praetorians are leveling the city. This isn't a conquest, it's a terror raid. You'll need to find and eliminate their commanders in order to buy us time to mount a counter attack to pin down and destroy their forces. Good luck."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P865821041" "The air is choked with smoke and powdered concrete. You can feel the thrumming pulse of a powerful energy field somewhere in the debris up ahead."
// ExitStringSuccess :
"P3671321351" "You are met by cheers as you return to the cluster of refugees hiding out beneath Skyway City. The invasion is over. You have won!"
// Script Variable BOSS_1_DISPLAYNAME :
"P814795676" "Wing Raider Officer"
// Script Variable BOSS_1_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2504292000" "<shout>We've got a break out in sector Alpha-Two, Hotel-Seven."
// Script Variable BOSS_1_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3769943105" "<shout>Colonel Duray needs our help, all available forces, respond."
// Script Variable BOSS_2_DISPLAYNAME :
"P1619467176" "Wing Raider"
// Script Variable BOSS_1_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P108814602" "<shout>This is Thunder Two-One, we are on scene in zero-five seconds, over."
// Script Variable BOSS_1_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P4083005694" "<shout>We've got heroes on Duray's position, moving to engage!"
// Script Variable BOSS_1_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1129178122" "<shout>All forces, go in, weapons hot."
// Script Variable BOSS_1_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2807542654" "<shout>This is Storm Wing reporting to breakout action in Alpha-Two, Hotel-Seven. Colonel Duray, please respond."
// Script Variable BOSS_1_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P1367872195" "<shout>Fighting looks heavy, engage and fire at will."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2516767187" "<t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DarkGoldenRod>Come in {TaskForceName}, this is Luminary. I've discovered the source of the earthquakes.<t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DarkGoldenRod>It appears that the Praetorians have in their service a super powered individual who can create them. You need to find that individual and eliminate them before the entire city is leveled."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1626507226" "<t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DarkGoldenRod>This is Luminary. Colonel Duray of the Sky Raiders is helping coordinate this attack with air support.<t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DarkGoldenRod>He's located just above your position. Our forces are currently unable to breach the IDF perimeter.<t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DarkGoldenRod>You're the only ones inside the perimeter that can stop them. {TaskForceName}, we need you.<t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DarkGoldenRod>Make your way topside, find Duray and his Praetorian counterpart, and apprehend them."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P540637607" "<t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DarkGoldenRod>{TaskForceName}, this is Luminary. My radar has detected hostile aircraft approaching Skyway City.<t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DarkGoldenRod>Exercise extreme caution, they appear to be carrying heavy munitions."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2755728764" "<t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DarkGoldenRod>{TaskForceName}, I've analyzed the aircraft. They're prototype Lockhart XF-40s.<t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DarkGoldenRod>The Sky Raiders must have been behind their theft from the Lockhart Avionics test range three months ago.<t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DarkGoldenRod>There's a squadron of them intercepting anything that comes near the city. It's going to be some time before the Airforce can punch a hole in there and assist you.<t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DarkGoldenRod>Until then I'm afraid you're going to have to make do on your own."
// Script Variable BOSS_1_DISPLAYNAME :
"P931974965" "Fusion"
// Script Variable BOSS_1_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2753808795" "<shout>Hurry up and finish it already. I'm getting tired of waiting for you to do your job."
// Script Variable BOSS_1_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2559973099" "<shout>Heh, looks like Riptide wasn't as tough as he thought.<em>Don't worry, 'babycakes', I'll deal with these losers myself."
// Script Variable BOSS_75HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P972665577" "Hey, Jane, get this loser off of me!"
// Script Variable BOSS_50HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P2096828358" "I said get off of me!"
// Script Variable BOSS_25HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P1481140862" "Jane, it's called teamwork! Know your role!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DEAD_DIALOG :
"P4254332184" "Oh man... this is bad..."
// Script Variable BOSS_KILLEDHERO_DIALOG :
"P2417800142" "<em victory>I can't believe YOU beat Riptide. You're both losers AND ugly."
// Script Variable BOSS_2_DISPLAYNAME :
"P3680623120" "Jane Temblor"
// Script Variable BOSS_2_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1722696507" "<shout><em t=5>You'd better hope that force field of yours is as big as your mouth, Fusion, because I'm about to drop an entire freeway down on us."
// Script Variable BOSS_2_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2268345351" "<em t=5><shout>Don't be an idiot, Fusion.<em>If Riptide and that 'head case' couldn't handle them then they're obviously tougher than they look.<em>We'll have to do this together.<em>Oh, and if you call me 'babycakes' one more time, I swear I will drop a skyscraper on you the next chance I get."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - ScriptDefeatFusionAndTemblor 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Description :
"P1109754540" "Defeat Fusion and Jane Temblor"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// CutScene 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// 6 Loyalist_Leader :
"P766447656" "<color FireBrick><bgcolor black>Fusion! I've lost contact with Riptide. I can only presume he's failed to hold off our pursuers. What is your status?"
// 6 Loyalist_Member_One :
"P3798285904" "<color White><bgcolor MidnightBlue>We're finishing up here, Colonel. Jane's just about got the whole place collapsed."
// 6 Caption :
"P2728262931" "<x=0.7 y=0.2 t=6 d=5><scale 1.75><color FireBrick><bgcolor black>If you have -just about everything- collapsed... Then why am I standing on a span of intact freeway!?!"
// 6 Caption :
"P2793456241" "<x=0.7 y=0.2 t=6 d=5><scale 1.75><color FireBrick><bgcolor black>Look... I know you two have the attention span of puppies. Jane is down there admiring her handiwork and you're busy being all proud of yourself."
// 6 Caption :
"P1053122043" "<x=0.7 y=0.2 t=6 d=5><scale 1.75><color FireBrick><bgcolor black>Just get that nitwit on the ball and level Skyway City or I'll do it for you AND leave you two buried down there together! Duray out."
// 8 Loyalist_Leader :
"P2997620155" "<color FireBrick><bgcolor black>If those two screwballs weren't walking weapons of mass destruction I would have volunteered them for Neuron's experiments months ago."
// 8 Resistance_Leader :
"P2028410398" "<color White><bgcolor Indigo>If you think they're bad, then be glad you're not from here! Those two are nothing compared to their lovey-dovey Primal counterparts."
// Script Variable RESISTANCE_LEADER_NAME :
"P2603343671" "Primal Col. Duray"
// Script Variable LOYALIST_LEADER_NAME :
"P1003012921" "Praetorian Col. Duray"
// Script Variable BOSS_1_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P4213022959" "<em t=5><shout>And while this city's defenders are paying attention to us, the true invasion lead by Battle Maiden will strike."
// Script Variable BOSS_1_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3883183616" "I see you managed to defeat my morons.<em>Bravo."
// Script Variable BOSS_1STBLOOD_DIALOG :
"P1876055079" "It's been a little while since I got to enjoy some close quarters fighting."
// Script Variable BOSS_75HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P2866900465" "Hey, I actually felt that through my armor. Maybe you are worth my full attention after all."
// Script Variable BOSS_50HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P2500441354" "Normally that wouldn't impress me, but since you're all a bunch of backwards savages and you managed to actually hurt me, call me surprised."
// Script Variable BOSS_25HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P1308372475" "<shout>Duray to Portal Command: Get a replacement suited up for me within the next minute, I may need him."
// Script Variable BOSS_DEAD_DIALOG :
"P2574295694" "<shout>Duray to Portal Command: Prepare for my reintegration."
// Script Variable BOSS_KILLEDHERO_DIALOG :
"P1054051252" "<em victory>Face it, your world doesn't need you anymore."
// Script Variable BOSS_2_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2397236053" "<shout>Once this place is suitably demolished we'll head for the Faultline Dam and hold the city hostage."
// Script Variable BOSS_2_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2319036335" "I told you not to underestimate them!<em>This is Colonel Duray to Zulu-One. I need air support on my position; we have some vipers in our back field."

